# FlutterGo MCP

When the user wants to create, preview, build, or deploy a Flutter app through FlutterGo:

1. Use the **fluttergo** MCP server (`https://fluttergo.ai/api/mcp/remote`).
2. If tools return unauthorized, complete FlutterGo OAuth (PKCE) in the browser — do not invent API keys.
3. Prefer cloud preview (`flutter_preview`) and Android APK build (`build_android`).
4. Never ask the user to paste Apple or Play signing secrets into chat.
5. For plan or pricing questions, use plan tools and link https://fluttergo.ai/pricing/ — do not invent prices or SKUs.
6. Confirm before destructive actions: delete file, delete project, or store deploy start.
